BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Working With Procrastination
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260822T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260822T150000
UID:6a3d62e5e5f29d2667fe3c67@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Psychotherapist Ann Schnurr looks at procrastination through a
  new lens\, What makes us procrastinate and what is the emotional toll on 
 depression and anxiety? Ways to re-engage and overcome procrastination wil
