DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260720T190000
UID:6a31536475b1e22800814e62@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Blackout poetry is a fresh form of ‘creative destruction’\
 , where instead of starting a poem with a blank page\, you take on a page 
