BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Image Editing for Beginners with Photoshop 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T160000
UID:6a2ac8ffc7d3cd58005f96e3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Adobe Photoshop is one of the world’s leading imaging and gr
 aphic design software and is at the core of just about every creative proj
 ect\, from photo editing and compositing to digital painting\, animation\,
  and graphic design.\nJoin us for an introductory lesson and learn about t
 he most common tools. We'll explore the workspace and enhance images while
  investigating tools such as select & mask\, hue & saturation\, layers and
  more. See how an image can be altered and repaired using patch tools such
