 on helps youth prepare for interviews by covering common questions\, how t
 o present themselves professionally\, and strategies to build confidence. 
 Participants will engage in practice scenarios and receive tips on how to 
 make a strong first impression.\nFor teen sessions\, bringing a resume is 
 optional.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\nThis program is part of Yo
 uth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school a
