UID:6a10e135278f7c2f008f09bc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun and creative\nShrink-it\nworkshop! Desi
 gn your own keychains\, charms\, and accessories using heat shrink plastic
  sheets. Simply draw and color your design\, cut it out\, and then watch t
 he magic happen as it shrinks in the oven to create a unique\, personalize
 d piece. Once it cools\, you’ll be able to turn it into a keychain or je
 welry to take home.\nAll materials are provided\, and no experience is nee
 ded. This program is for teens ages 13–17 and is drop-in only.\nThis pro
 gram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for te
 ens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always availa
 ble. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a
 \nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
