BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coding with Python
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T200000
UID:6a187920703c3363002a9372@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Python is an open source programming language that is used for
  creating web applications\, web content\, mathematics and system scriptin
 g. In this course you will learn how python code works and given time to p
 ractice. Prior coding knowledge is not necessary for this introductory cla
 ss. Key takeaways will include a working knowledge of variables\, loops\, 
 conditional arguments and more.\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Co
 llection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by th
 e Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\,
  20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and progra
 m registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library 
 handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerlin
 e@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fort York
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a187920703c3363002a9372
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Advanced Robotics with LEGO Mindstorm EV3
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T180000
UID:6a19cf61caf93436005f2e6b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This week-long workshop is designed to take teens' robotics sk
 ills to the next level by delving into the advanced capabilities of the LE
 GO Mindstorms EV3 platform. Participants will engage in challenging projec
 ts that emphasize complex programming\, sophisticated sensor integration\,
  and innovative design principles. Through hands-on experimentation and cr
 eative problem-solving\, students will gain the knowledge and confidence t
 o tackle real-world robotics challenges with ingenuity and skill. This wor
 kshop is run by ICE Robotics.
LOCATION:Albion\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a19cf61caf93436005f2e6b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
