UID:6a3b164148c98c3600a1ea6a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Summer Ready with Boba!\nYou will learn how to prepare a class
 ic milk bubble tea\, including decorating and mixing techniques\, as well 
 as the breakdown of core ingredients. (*contains dairy and caffeine)\nFood
  allergy notice: Please be aware that food will be used in this program th
 at contains gluten and dairy.  Certain food ingredients may cause allergic
  reactions in some people.\nDrop-in.\nLimit: 15 teens.\nThis program is pa
 rt of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after 
 school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free
 \, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hu
 b\nor call the branch to find out more.
