UID:6a283f8e7550c8bf9f5c143e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Let's read together this summer! Join us in the Youth Hub for 
 silent book club. Bring your own book\, or choose something from our colle
 ction\, and spend some time silently reading together. Afterwards\, we'll 
 all discuss what we were reading together! Drop in\, no registration requi
 red!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcomin
 g place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are
  always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a
  branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
